<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring wheat bids mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring wheat bids mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spring wheat cash basis bids were mixed on Wednesday as dealers noted continued slow farmer sales.</p>
<p>&quot;It has been extremely quiet,&quot; a Minneapolis dealer said, adding that there were very few spot cars for shipment.</p>
<p>In North Dakota, very little wheat was moving because the focus was on the soybean harvest in the eastern part of the state, a merchandiser said.</p>
<p>MGE December spring wheat futures was unchanged at $422-3/4 a bushel.  </p>
